==Description==
The '''Rich Nametag''' is a {{Color|Legendary}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''Rich Nametag''' has text with slight white to green gradient and a black outline, with Robux bills occasionally floating around.

